<h2>Segment 352 &mdash; four kinds of sexual misconduct</h2>
<div class="pair">
<div class="tib"><div class="lab">TIBETAN (WYLIE)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s352S"><span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s352w1">gzhan</span> gyis bdag tu bzung ba&#x27;i <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s352w2">chung ma</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s352p1">dang</span> , de <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s352p2">min</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s352p3">yang</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s352w3">rang</span> gi <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s352w4">ma</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s352p4">dang</span> srid mo <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s352p5">dang</span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s352f1">pha ma bdun rgyud</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s352p6">tshun chad du</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s352w5">&#x27;brel ba</span>&#x27;i <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s352w6">nye du</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s352w7">mo</span> dang , <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s352w8">rang</span> gi <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s352w9">chung ma</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s352p7">yin yang</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s352w10">yan lag</span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s352f2">ma yin pa</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s352w11">kha</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s352p8">dang</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s352w12">gshang lam</span> dang , <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s352w13">yul</span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s352f3">ma yin pa</span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s352f4">snang ba dang bcas pa</span> dang , <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s352w14">mchod rten</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s352p9">dang</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s352w15">gtsug lag khang</span> gi <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s352p10">drung du</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s352p11">dang</span> , <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s352w16">dus</span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s352f5">ma yin pa</span> <span cl