<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; Codex independent TIBETAN-FIRST PROVISIONAL proposal. Raw SRID MO remains unbanked with a probable spelling question; source text is never corrected. Kinship/ancestral-count scope and the three improper conditions are explicit. Whole visibility and nursing phrases remain provisional; SPYAD observing is not blindly preferred over the local vow-keeping GNAS PA. Introductory four/types and repeated sex framing are not invented atoms. Source origin bd2f2ebafd06d389f2d896cd88a3f53fd7edd5e4 through348; actual acceptance baseline is a separate later checkpoint.</div>
